    "replace": "MINIMUM_COUNTER_EXAMPLES = 1",
    "with": "MINIMUM_COUNTER_EXAMPLES = 0",
    "test": "tests/test_work_without_unit_tests_still_has_a_standard.py::test_a_dimension_with_no_counter_example_is_rejected"
  },
  {
    "label": "Y3 「不好」也算一個案例（一句話講不完的東西被寫成一句話，而審查那一格只能自己編）",
