    "file": "app/services/qualitative_acceptance.py",
    "replace": "    problems: list[str] = []\n    for dimension in rubric.dimensions:\n        problems.extend(_problems_with(dimension))\n    return problems",
    "with": "    return []",
    "test": "tests/test_work_without_unit_tests_still_has_a_standard.py::test_a_broken_rubric_is_worse_than_none_so_it_also_stops"
  },
  {
    "label": "Y9 讀不到標準時回一份空的而不是 None（打錯字的設定檔變成「這個專案沒有驗收標準」，跟「還沒設定」長得一樣）",
    "file": "app/services/qualitative_acceptance.py",
    "replace": "    if not isinstance(raw, dict) or ACCEPTANCE_KEY not in raw:\n        return None",
    "with": "    if not isinstance(raw, dict) or ACCEPTANCE_KEY not in raw:\n        return Rubric(dimensions=())",
    "test": "tests/test_work_without_unit_tests_still_has_a_standard.py::test_a_project_with_neither_still_stops"
  },
  {
